  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Media in Libya: Immune against Disinformation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The actions overall objective (OO) is to provide Libyans with improved access to independent and accurate information since well-informed citizens are an indispensable prerequisite for any form of peaceful democratic transition and conflict prevention. The specific objective aims at strenghtening Libyan media professionals (journalists, fact-checkers and influencers) and international political decision makers.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
